nd senders\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d35bdbdc/28/code.py:67:      - each surviving group has three sprites, so the middle sprite clearly participates as both receiver and sender\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9aaea919/D13/1/code.py:108:      green bars mark eligible receiver lanes.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/9aaea919/D13/1/code.py:114:    - The receiver is directional: use the nearest green lane strictly to the right of the red lane; if none exists,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/24/code.py:26:#      receiver, and the water must leave the lower chamber by rising upward.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/24/code.py:35:#    uses one dominant receiver basin with two controlled shape families:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/24/code.py:36:#    - a plain inverted U receiver,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/24/code.py:37:#    - or, for the narrower layout, the same receiver with one inner step.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/24/code.py:39:#    that the key transformation is \"internal lower source -> upward evacuation into a top receiver\".\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/24/code.py:51:#    and receiver walls occupy disjoint coordinates; all placements stay within the 10x10 canvas.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/24/code.py:54:#    In every accepted sample, all blue cells begin in the lower chamber and end in the upper receiver.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/24/code.py:58:#    Only two solid colors are used: one for the source chamber and one for the receiver structure.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/24/code.py:65:#    - the chosen receiver shapes never create ambiguous nearest-drop or diagonal choices.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/24/code.py:170:    stepped_receiver: bool,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/24/code.py:174:    assert not stepped_re