me/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/8/code.py:68:#   each hub has exactly two same-colored receiver diamonds, matching the two\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/8/code.py:268:    Route each solid sender's missing corner-set to a shared receiver hub, completing stacked solids.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/8/code.py:273:    - Source tokens are solid 3x3 blocks. Destination hubs already contain one or more same-colored diamond receivers.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/8/code.py:274:    - Several different wire components can target the same hub anchor, and the hub's extra receivers are pre-stacked to the right.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/8/code.py:277:    - Every solid sender loses its corners and becomes a diamond in place.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/8/code.py:280:    - If more arrivals target that same anchor, they do not overwrite the finished block; instead they complete the next unused receiver diamond in the hub's rightward stack.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/8/code.py:283:    - The remote action is now both overlay and collision resolution: wires reveal which senders belong to the same anchor, then the output fills a same-colored receiver row from left to right with full 3x3 blocks.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/8/code.py:408:    # through the first hub's receiver stack.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e376de54/D6/0/code.py:323:            receiver_choices = [i for i in range(len(gaps)) if i != donor]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e376de54/D6/0/code.py:324:            receiver = random.choice(receiver_choices)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e376de54/D6/0/code.py:326:            gaps[receiver] += unit\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/28/code.py:23:#    - Replace the original \"one active sender + one empty/partial far side\" state with a fully bidirectional pair:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/28/code.py:45:#      mostly empty or at most had one passive receiver. Here every endpoint already contains a token fragment.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/28/code.py:293:    - No endpoint is merely a passive receiver anymore. The solver must pair the two routed endpoints, verify that they\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:20:#    (receiver) and the lower-anchor family is B (donor). B never changes. A no longer\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:28:#    This makes the visible states {unchanged donor, round-1 receiver, round-2 receiver}\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:34:#    receiver rounds, so the palette transfer is structured rather than free-form.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:49:#    grid can overlap or go out of bounds. Receiver hybrids keep the receiver geometry,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:62:#    The two donor colors are forced to be disjoint from the two receiver colors. That\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:77:#    - scale-1 receiver sprites encode round 1 and enlarged receiver sprites encode round 2\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:129:def _make_receiver_round(receiver_proto: np.ndarray, donor_proto: np.ndarray, bg: int, rounds: int) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:130:    receiver_slots = _ordered_variable_slots(receiver_proto, bg)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:132:    out = receiver_proto.copy()\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:135:        _receiver_color, receiver_mask = receiver_slots[idx]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:136:        out[receiver_mask] = donor_color\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:226:    - Both prototypes share a color-1 anchor region and have two variable-color slots, but one family places the anchor visibly higher (receiver A) and the other lower (donor B).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:230:    - Keep every donor-B sprite unchanged. For each receiver-A sprite, preserve its own geometry and anchor alignment, but recolor its variable slots using B's ordered colors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:259:    receiver_proto, donor_proto = raw_protos\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:260:    round1_proto = _make_receiver_round(receiver_proto, donor_proto, bg, rounds=1)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:261:    round2_proto = _make_receiver_round(receiver_proto, donor_proto, bg, rounds=2)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:263:    receiver_anchor = _pick_anchor_bbox(receiver_proto, bg)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:265:    receiver_anchor_h = receiver_anchor[2] - receiver_anchor[0] + 1\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:266:    receiver_anchor_w = receiver_anchor[3] - receiver_anchor[1] + 1\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:269:    assert (receiver_anchor_h, receiver_anchor_w) == (donor_anchor_h, donor_anchor_w), \"prototype anchors must share a size\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:274:        scale, anc = _infer_scale(sprite[\"arr\"], receiver_anchor_h, receiver_anchor_w, bg)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:429:    receiver_proto, donor_proto = ordered\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:430:    receiver_colors = {color for color, _mask in _ordered_variable_slots(receiver_proto, bg)}\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:432:    assert receiver_colors.isdisjoint(donor_colors), \"receiver and donor colors must be distinct\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:433:    return receiver_proto, donor_proto\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:446:    receiver_big = random.choice(BIG_SCALES)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:451:        (0, receiver_big, 2),\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:461:    receiver_proto, donor_proto = _make_prototypes(bg)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:462:    round1_proto = _make_receiver_round(receiver_proto, donor_proto, bg, rounds=1)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:463:    round2_proto = _make_receiver_round(receiver_proto, donor_proto, bg, rounds=2)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:465:    assert not np.array_equal(receiver_proto, round1_proto), \"round-1 state must be visible\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/c7f57c3e/6/code.py:468:    raw_protos = [receiver_proto, donor_proto]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7ed72f31/23/code.py:35:      下侧有一个同色 receiver，含像素 (10,5),(11,5),(11,6)，它起初不贴轴。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7ed72f31/23/code.py:37:      这些新像素与下侧 receiver 连成一个更大的蓝色连通块，并且触到 axis+1。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7ed72f31/23/code.py:39:      原位以外，还会把 receiver 映到上侧新增 (6,5),(5,5),(5,6) 中的高处像素。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7ed72f31/23/code.py:41:      新逻辑会额外生成这些由 receiver 贡献的上侧像素。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7ed72f31/23/code.py:48:    2. 一个被激活的第二阶段 receiver\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7ed72f31/23/code.py:67:  - 组件之间用槽位分开，避免无意接触；只有预期的 seed->receiver 位置会接触。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/29/code.py:343:            receiver = random.choice([i for i in range(len(gaps)) if i != donor])\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/29/code.py:345:            gaps[receiver] += unit\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9aaea919/24/code.py:239:    Key insight: One visible quantity, sprite count, controls the whole transformation twice: first to decide which lanes donate or receive, then again to decide which donor matches which receiver.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9aaea919/37/code.py:30:#    - D8/0 forces the task to be sequential, so this combo keeps two green receiver lanes.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9aaea919/37/code.py:46:#    - Roles are intentionally kept to four lanes total: exactly 2 green receivers, 1 red mover,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9aaea919/37/code.py:84:#    - Colors keep the original semantics: red bars mark moving lanes, green bars mark receivers,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9aaea919/37/code.py:233:    - The dominant color is the background. Exactly two green 1x5 bars mark receiver lanes,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9aaea919/7/code.py:24:#    - A single green lane remains the only receiver and all sprites keep the same shape,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/21/code.py:334:            receiver = random.choice([i for i in range(len(gaps)) if i != donor])\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/21/code.py:336:            gaps[receiver] += unit\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/64efde09/20/code.py:52:#     vertical receiver, reversed horizontal receiver.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/64efde09/20/code.py:77:#   - D14 is visible because the reversed vertical and reversed horizontal receivers put\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
